{"id":"vod_sn_38759","vodId":"38759","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"猜谜王","name_cn":"猜谜王","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/314fa3685175b5d7bca9d61155ca8c64.jpg"},"summary":"文藏高中新生欢迎会。　　1年级的越山识，意外地被猜谜研究会要求参加了“新生抢答大赛”。　　就在爱好读书且不喜欢引人注目的识感到慌张的时候，同班的深见真理在谜题读完之前就接连按下按钮，压倒周围的人们。　　“知道答案后再按下去就太迟了。抢答在0.01秒的差距下，就能分出胜败”　　在看着这样的真理的途中，识注意到了“在猜谜当中有着能确定答案的要点”……。　　与猜谜研究会的前辈及伙伴、以及拥有压倒性强大的对手·御来屋千智的相遇，正解时的喜悦，无法按下按钮时的悔恨……　　并不只是知识，也要磨炼各种技术，并与同伴一同以胜利为目标的“竞技猜谜”的世界当中，越山识以猜谜拼上青春的每一天开始了。by 百度","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bj2uHapU8A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bAiqv7x1Zy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z9B2958KPE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aKEgpYNSYY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ni6iML6XiM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zhq9PXrZWN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z050W4wiDX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DtEQDbFKzf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VP9HipkUmY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ANAAi4Kcs51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kwRDUCnSaN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HBRE6vZTwS1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.872Z"}